        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apoclone is a post-apocalyptic idle strategy RPG that combines hero collection, tactical mech combat, and a deep formation system. As a Commander in a ruined world dominated by rogue science, you’ll lead a clone army against mutant forces and twisted warlords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and upgrade clone heroes from rival factions, each with unique skills and elemental powers. Unleash mighty Titans to shift the tide of battle in strategic, turn-based combat. From PvE dungeons and tower challenges to global PvP arenas, every fight tests your strategy and team synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apoclone also features an idle system that lets you collect rewards while offline, making progression smooth and satisfying for all types of players. Customize your lineup, optimize your gear, and dive into the lore of a world ravaged by cloning experiments gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a tactical mastermind or a casual player, Apoclone offers intense strategy, striking visuals, and endless battles to explore—all from the comfort of your browser.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apoclone is a post-apocalyptic idle strategy RPG that combines hero collection, tactical mech combat, and a deep formation system. As a Commander in a ruined world dominated by rogue science, you’ll lead a clone army against mutant forces and twisted warlords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and upgrade clone heroes from rival factions, each with unique skills and elemental powers. Unleash mighty Titans to shift the tide of battle in strategic, turn-based combat. From PvE dungeons and tower challenges to global PvP arenas, every fight tests your strategy and team synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apoclone also features an idle system that lets you collect rewards while offline, making progression smooth and satisfying for all types of players. Customize your lineup, optimize your gear, and dive into the lore of a world ravaged by cloning experiments gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a tactical mastermind or a casual player, Apoclone offers intense strategy, striking visuals, and endless battles to explore—all from the comfort of your browser.</p>",
        "short_description": "Apoclone is a post-apocalyptic idle strategy RPG where you command a squad of clone warriors and unleash powerful mechs in turn-based combat. Strategize your formation, conquer enemies in PvE and PvP, and thrive in a ruined world—even while offline.",
